>> title: BLT
>> category: Sandwiches & Rolls
>> tags: bacon, tomato, lettuce, sandwich, lunch
>> counters: Diner
>> aka: BLT, bacon lettuce and tomato, bacon lettuce tomato sandwich, bacon sandwich
>> servings: 2
>> time: 20 min

>> step: render 10 min, from a cold pan
Fry @thick-cut bacon{6%slices} laid in a cold #skillet{} brought slowly to medium ~fry{10%min}, turning once.

>> step: toast the four slices 2 min
Toast @white sandwich bread{4%slices} ~toast{2%min}, to firm rather than dark.

>> step: spread both inside faces
Spread @mayonnaise{3%Tbs}(45 mL) over both inside faces of @&(~1)toast{}.

>> step: salt the tomato, layer, cut once
Layer @&(~3)bacon{}, @beefsteak tomato{1%large}(in 1/4-in slices), @iceberg lettuce{4%leaves}(cold and dry), @kosher salt{1/4%tsp} and @black pepper{1/4%tsp} onto @&(~1)dressed toast{}, and cut it once on the diagonal.
